        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a hard game.</strong><br><br>With nothing but your pogo stick to rely on, your goal is simple: reach the top - where the beyond awaits.<br><br>The controls are simple: mouse to tilt, space to jump. Controllers supported.<br><br>Don't be fooled by the simplicity. Between trampolines, swings, and massive leaps, every bounce is a test of precision and patience.<br><br>You'll fall. A lot. And when you do, there are no checkpoints waiting to comfort you.<br><br>Just you, your pogo stick, and a long way up.<br><br>This game is not for the faint of heart - it's for those willing to climb, fall, and climb again.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a hard game.</strong><br><br>With nothing but your pogo stick to rely on, your goal is simple: reach the top - where the beyond awaits.<br><br>The controls are simple: mouse to tilt, space to jump. Controllers supported.<br><br>Don't be fooled by the simplicity. Between trampolines, swings, and massive leaps, every bounce is a test of precision and patience.<br><br>You'll fall. A lot. And when you do, there are no checkpoints waiting to comfort you.<br><br>Just you, your pogo stick, and a long way up.<br><br>This game is not for the faint of heart - it's for those willing to climb, fall, and climb again.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p>",
        "short_description": "A hard game about climbing with nothing but your pogo stick. Simple controls, endless falls, and no mercy.",
